  Input:
  [[ 1.2 -0.3  0.7]
  [ 2.1  0.5 -1. ]]
  >>> print("Output:\n", quantized_data.numpy())
  Output:
  [[ 0.8003921 -0.3007843  0.6984313]
  [ 0.8003921  0.4996078 -0.4996078]]

